ed quantity.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-27.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The Quality Officer response status is 403 and the Quality Manager response status is 200.\",\n     \"when\": \"Each account submits the contract's signed `POST /api/quality/recalls/{recallId}/write-offs` operation for that recall.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A customer account password is set through a contract-defined password-setting operation.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-27.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The row's password field contains a salted password hash that verifies against the submitted password and does not equal the plaintext password.\",\n     \"when\": \"A test reads the corresponding PostgreSQL account row and verifies the stored password value against the submitted password.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A valid staff identity-provider token has an email claim matching an enabled PostgreSQL account assigned permission to use a protected contract operation.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-27.5\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is the operation's contract-declared success status.\",\n     \"when\": \"The caller sends the token with a request to that operation.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A valid staff identity-provider token has no matching PostgreSQL account email, or matches a disabled account.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-27.6\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 403.\",\n     \"when\": \"The caller sends the token with a request to a protected contract operation.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"anchors\": [\n    {\n     \"lineEnd\": 40,\n     \"lineStart\": 20,\n     \"path\": \"contracts/openapi.yaml\",\n     \"quote\": \"  /auth/customer/sign-in:\\n    post:\\n      operationId: signInCustomer\\n      summary: \\\"Submit customer email and password and begin one-time-code verification.\\\"\\n      requestBody:\\n        required: true\\n        content:\\n          application/json:\\n 